WEBVTT

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:37.400
Lag's back, but he suddenly collapsed again?

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:47.040
Well... I think he looks okay.

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:49.420
But, why...

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:54.630
The Lost Shindan

00:01:55.270 --> 00:01:59.030
See? I told you he was Noir from the start!

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:02.360
Gauche said he was Noir himself, right?

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:04.220
That wasn't Gauche!

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:06.420
There is that possibility...

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:09.070
That is what I told the Master, however...

00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:11.230
Dr. Thunderland?

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:16.810
Using the memories contained in the 
letter bullet that Seeing shot into him,

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:18.820
he could be able to act like Suede.

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:22.450
So... You're saying his memories 
never came back from the start?

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:26.450
Sylvette?

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:30.280
It's not true...

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:31.750
Sylvette...

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.630
It was my brother, I know it!

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:37.550
Because... Because...

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:42.750
How many years has it been since 
my heart has felt this warmth?

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:44.580
It is delicious.

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:46.970
You are a gifted cook.

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.210
He'd finally come back to me...

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:55.100
Listen, Sylvette.

00:02:55.640 --> 00:03:02.240
I heard from a certain person that 
Akatsuki's artificial sun steals people's hearts.

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:12.250
It's already beyond the point where it 
can be gathered and returned to him.

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:14.950
A heart, once lost, can never be returned?

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:17.250
Is that true, Doctor?

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:19.740
I do not know.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:26.530
But Suede... I mean, Noir tried to 
kill Seeing. That's what he said.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.790
He tried to kill Lag?

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.150
Why?

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:43.250
A gaichuu with wings?

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:46.370
Yeah. The kids said they saw it.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:50.040
They said it crashed over 
there by Shark Cape.

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:51.790
Cabernet...

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:01.930
Wasiolka, send this message to the Master.

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:03.840
This time I'm gonna bust that thing up!

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:09.200
I'm counting on you, Wasiolka.

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:12.730
It ain't like me to wait for backup, though.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:15.030
Help me!

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:20.790
Somebody, help me!

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.630
Tch... A Jinro?

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:28.910
That guy's weakpoint is its mouth, but...

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.410
Blue Thorn!

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.170
Damn, I have to get underneath it!

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:44.780
I'm gonna get rid of every last 
one of you damn gaichuu...

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:56.270
Okay, over here!

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:58.360
Help me!

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.210
This is it!

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:08.620
Blue Thorn!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:20.030
Crap!

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:32.930
Weren't you trying to save the kid?

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.430
I beat the gaichuu.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:39.710
And why did you do that?

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.600
Do I even need to say the reason?

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:44.430
They steal letters and people's hearts!

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:47.810
So to a Letter Bee, it's only natural, yes?

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:49.430
That's about right.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.360
Hey, wait!

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:55.860
Who the hell are...

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:10.330
Why?

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:13.070
Is the Cabernet here in this place?

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:15.250
The Cabernet ain't here.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:17.920
So you still do not trust me?

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:19.800
We trust you.

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:22.860
That's why we're having you help 
us with this important job.

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:26.130
This is the Rosie river.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:29.360
I see.

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:34.990
The place where ones who were unable 
to become spirit sometimes wash down...

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:44.520
Much the same as Holden Caulfield, the place 
used to construct the Airship Project,

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:48.880
there was a secret government research 
laboratory upstream from here also.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:50.510
Research laboratory?

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:54.220
It was abandoned long ago, however.

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:55.040
Look!

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:08.150
Noir, that place is...

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:08.900
Roda...

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:13.160
Move!

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:48.440
This is the disposal area for the failed 
experiments the laboratory created.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.570
Failed experiments?

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:51.820
Graveyard...

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:03.390
What are you doing?

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:17.090
Those are...

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:19.810
Ones who were not able to become spirit.

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:22.410
I was also one of them.

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.940
And I ran away to the outside.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:28.000
There might still be live ones around!

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:28.980
Hurry up and search!

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:41.900
They are all dead...

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.460
Why would they do this?

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:49.400
Once, when the artificial sun 
was about to lose its light,

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.550
two lines of research were started.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:55.990
The first was to observe and make 
adjustments to the sun using the airship.

00:08:55.990 --> 00:08:59.260
The other was a plan to 
create artificial spirit.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.640
Artificial spirit?

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:05.710
Spirit Insects are insects in which reside 
spirit energy of the ancient land.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:10.020
They tried to create other creatures 
that held the same power.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:11.650
For what purpose?

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:16.780
It is said that the artificial sun 
is made to shine with spirit energy.

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:19.290
But no matter how brightly it shines,

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:23.090
the only ones to benefit are the 
people who live close to the capital!

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:24.310
Yeah, right.

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:30.810
And still they did this experiment just to 
make the artificial sun shine brightly again!

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:34.800
They used people and other living things, 
in order to try to create spirit?

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:40.070
But after every experiment failed, 
this place was also closed down.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:43.770
And so, all the many 
failures were disposed of.

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:47.890
I guess there ain't anyone 
that's still alive...

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:51.020
Waste of our time...

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:19.950
One of the systems was still active!

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:22.240
The automatic waste disposal system!

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:24.680
If you get sucked in, there 
won't even be scraps left!

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:25.890
Noir!

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:28.550
I know I heard something...

00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:30.190
Noir, that's enough!

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:32.500
Noir!

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:41.360
Noir!

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:43.490
Noir!

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:37.340
It seems like Caribs Garrard and Hazle 
Valentine being Marauders was no error.

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:40.340
The government has finally accepted it.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:43.380
What could have happened to those two?

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:48.600
They were supposed to have a bright 
future as Head Bee and his dingo...

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:52.310
Gauche also lost his heart in Akatsuki.

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:55.690
Something is going on there.

00:12:02.510 --> 00:12:04.360
Lag, you musn't! You have to rest!

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:07.160
Don't worry, Sylvette.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.490
I'll go bring Gauche back soon.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:14.370
Please! Think about your 
own health right now.

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:16.890
I don't have the time.

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:22.290
I believe that my shindan 
can bring Gauche back!

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:30.970
What'll I do if you find him, 
and he shoots you again?

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:36.350
I don't want you to be hurt anymore, Lag...

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.300
Lag, it's Wasiolka.

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:42.460
Wasiolka? Where's Zazie?

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:43.620
Huh?

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:45.610
There's something in Wasiolka's mouth...

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:55.250
Cabernet... Beside it is... Reverse?

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:57.450
Lag, what kind of letter is it?

00:12:57.450 --> 00:13:00.020
Sylvette, I have to go.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.460
Please give this to the Master!

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:05.680
Wasiolka, show us the way!

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:09.500
Lag...

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:16.890
Where'd that guy go?

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:21.460
You're a Bee, ain't ya?

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:24.650
Now that you've seen this 
place, prepare to die!

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:27.850
Pirates? No, but maybe...

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:29.720
Reverse, are we?

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.660
What's so funny?

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:34.170
We're not scared of you!

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:35.830
Bee weapons don't work on humans!

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:38.670
Oh, yeah? Let's find out!

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:44.820
Blue Thorn.

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.610
The Blue Thorn is my malice.

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:53.240
You're gonna be feelin' awful for a few days.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:02.030
I found you, you big-ass dragonfly!

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:11.250
You're... One who couldn't become spirit?

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:14.520
My name is Jeel, and I am a Marauder.

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:19.830
If you lay a hand on the Cabernet, 
I will rob you of your life.

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:22.220
Is that so?

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:25.840
But I came all this way so 
I could kill that thing!

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:26.880
Give me your paw, lil' doggie!

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:29.300
Not a dog...

00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:37.980
A wolf!

00:14:39.680 --> 00:14:42.630
You said that gaichuu steal hearts...

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:45.380
But the government also steals hearts.

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:47.560
Don't you know about the Day of Flicker?

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:50.240
Huh? What're you sayin'?

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:54.750
The artificial sun shines 
by stealing people's hearts.

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:57.300
My heart has all been stolen.

00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:59.740
I hate that light.

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:01.340
I don't get you!

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:02.570
Blue Thorn!

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:08.380
Here I come!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.950
You can't dodge now.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:11.590
Blue Thorn!

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:16.330
How do you like my...

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:42.950
What? Why doesn't it work?

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:47.290
This... is hatred?

00:15:48.140 --> 00:15:51.120
Gaichuu ate your parents' hearts.

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:55.890
All you could do was watch as your 
family died without their hearts.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:00.520
And you became a Bee to get revenge...

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:04.230
Zazie... That is your name...

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:05.240
Take this!

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:14.310
Malice, hatred... Those 
will not work on me, Zazie.

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:15.690
What do you mean?

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:18.610
The same things reside within me.

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:21.280
I am one whose heart has been stolen.

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:24.030
My hatred, my malice for the light.

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:25.690
The same?

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:27.610
The same, Zazie.

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:32.770
And my hatred is far stronger 
and deeper than yours.

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:36.680
That is why I will not 
be moved by your heart.

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:39.970
Reverse will never waiver.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:47.310
Bees give themselves to the government 
and get status, glory, money, light...

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:49.780
But none are what you desire.

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:52.380
Is all you really want "revenge"?

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:54.240
Wasiolka?

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:58.560
Did you deliver the letter, Wasiolka?

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:00.240
It doesn't matter.

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:02.340
Right now I'm beating this bad little doggie!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:07.880
Zazie, I acknowledge your 
honest, straightforward heart.

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:11.750
If we were not enemies, 
perhaps we would be friends.

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:14.490
No thanks, buddy!

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:16.760
I'm a cat person!

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:23.640
Where'd Wasiolka go?

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:25.280
That's...

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:27.380
Cabernet!

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:30.060
Red Needle!

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:35.420
What's wrong?

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:39.430
Weird... My heart isn't 
loading into the Nocturne.

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:47.470
You cannot defeat the Cabernet 
as you are now, Lag Seeing.

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:49.360
The leader of Reverse?

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:50.870
Lawrence.

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:53.050
Where is Gauche?

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.130
Good question.

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:56.970
And you plan on aiming that gun at him?

00:17:57.500 --> 00:18:00.500
You've tricked Gauche!

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:01.630
Have we, now?

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:06.960
Just now, you could not shoot 
a shindan into the Cabernet.

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:07.810
Do you know why?

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:15.190
Perhaps it's because you understand the 
feelings of Gauche and ourselves, who raised it?

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:17.780
Lag?

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:23.970
Even so... I-I'm a Letter Bee!

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:27.840
Shindan Loaded!

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:32.200
The shindan...

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:34.830
Shindan Loaded!

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.880
I can't load a shindan!

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:40.100
Why?

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:47.600
Your gun takes your innocent wish to 
deliver letters, to deliver heart,

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:50.500
and it turns that heart into a bullet.

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:53.570
But you do not have that heart now.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:55.790
You are wandering, lost.

00:18:57.480 --> 00:19:01.590
You are worried about whether to 
treat Gauche as an enemy or not.

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:03.420
You are losing confidence in your belief

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:07.580
that Reverse is wrong and the 
Amberground government is correct.

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:11.290
You've finally lost sight of your own heart.

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:13.460
There is nothing to be afraid of.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:16.000
I will give you it to you...

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.550
...your true heart!

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:46.660
Next: Neither Malice, Nor Hatred
